### Simple prompt
POST http://localhost:8767/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "What is 2+2? Answer with just the number."
}

###

### JSON response test
POST http://localhost:8767/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Return a JSON object with keys: name, age, city. Use fake data. Return ONLY the JSON, nothing else."
}

###

### Raw mode (no system suffix appended)
POST http://localhost:8767/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "Write a haiku about coding",
  "append_suffix": false
}

###

### Custom timeout (seconds)
POST http://localhost:8767/prompt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "prompt": "List 3 programming languages and one strength of each. Be brief.",
  "timeout": 60
}

